        "detailed_description": "<h1>Bug Test</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4001640/extras/99e7e67724b2328bf7acdd5c7a83eb0d.avif?t=1777431754\" width=1560 height=406 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you encounter any issues or bugs while playing the game, reporting them through 'Discord' allows for faster resolution.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can join 'Discord' via the link on the Steam store page.</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Finding Momo</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Finding Momo</strong> is a fast-paced yet heartwarming ESG 3D runner that begins in the lively streets of <strong>Busan</strong>. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as <strong><u><i>Jon</i></u></strong><i>,</i> an adventurer on a mission to find his missing friend, <strong>Momo</strong>. Dash through busy urban alleys and scenic coastal roads, dodge obstacles, collect <strong><i><u>recyclable items</u></i></strong> to restore the city, and rescue sea animals in need. The perspective shifts dynamically between <strong><i><u>side view and back view</u></i></strong><u>,</u> giving each run a fresh and cinematic feel. The more you run, the more life and nature return to the world around you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4001640/extras/68aa774fa63727b3c099f40ee661ed79.avif?t=1777431754\" width=558 height=396 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🐾 Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start in <strong>Busan</strong> and journey through <strong>diverse cities across the globe</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore vibrant <strong>3D environments inspired by real urban and coastal scenery</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4001640/extras/a03c8feaade8d34ee01fd77bac31c572.poster.avif?t=1777431754\" width=559 height=396 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4001640/extras/a03c8feaade8d34ee01fd77bac31c572.webm?t=1777431754\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic camera angles</strong>: switch seamlessly between side-scrolling and back-view running</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Collect recyclable items and bring nature back</strong> as you run</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4001640/extras/6cc48775365be3588c89159bda5a544c.poster.avif?t=1777431754\" width=559 height=396 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4001640/extras/6cc48775365be3588c89159bda5a544c.webm?t=1777431754\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Encounter and rescue endangered sea animals</strong> along the way</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4001640/extras/df64de17ef3364cd5b6e10755d016dde.poster.avif?t=1777431754\" width=559 height=396 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4001640/extras/df64de17ef3364cd5b6e10755d016dde.webm?t=1777431754\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A cozy and colorful <strong>art style with charming characters</strong></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock fun <strong>character customization options</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Accessible <strong>single-player gameplay</strong> for casual and indie fans</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4001640/extras/a3d656b833ebfc8053e6ba6bde8481e5.poster.avif?t=1777431754\" width=559 height=396 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4001640/extras/a3d656b833ebfc8053e6ba6bde8481e5.webm?t=1777431754\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More than just chasing high scores, <strong>Finding Momo</strong> is a wholesome adventure about caring for the world around us—and never giving up on the friends (and pets!) we love.</p>",
